#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid ""
"If you satisfactorily complete the study, we compensate you for your "
"participation:"
msgstr ""
"Ako na zadovoljavajući način završite studij, nadoknađujemo vam vaše "
"sudjelovanje:"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid "We appreciate your contribution to science!"
msgstr "Cijenimo vaš doprinos znanosti!"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid ""
"You may also receive an additional payment based on your performance in the "
"task."
msgstr ""
"Također možete dobiti dodatnu uplatu na temelju vašeg učinka u zadatku."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"The purpose of this project is to study how people from different places in "
"the world experience sounds (e.g., speech, music) and images (e.g., faces, "
"color)."
msgstr ""
"Svrha ovog projekta je proučavanje kako ljudi s različitih mjesta u svijetu "
"doživljavaju zvukove (npr. govor, glazbu) i slike (npr. lica, boju)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid "Confidentiality"
msgstr "Povjerljivost"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/voluntary_with_no_compensation_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid "Compensation"
msgstr "Kompenzacija"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-benefits"
msgid ""
"Although it may not directly benefit you, this study may benefit society by "
"helping us understanding how humans derive information from sound and "
"vision, and potentially to help engineer machines that can replicate our "
"abilities (e.g. in sound recognition and computer vision) and to help "
"improve perceptual abilities in people whose hearing or sight is impaired."
msgstr ""
"Iako vama možda neće izravno koristiti, ova bi studija mogla koristiti "
"društvu tako što će nam pomoći da razumijemo kako ljudi dobivaju informacije"
" iz zvuka i vida, te potencijalno pomoći u projektiranju strojeva koji mogu "
"replicirati naše sposobnosti (npr. u prepoznavanju zvuka i računalnog vida) "
"i pomoći u poboljšanju perceptivne sposobnosti kod osoba čiji je sluh ili "
"vid oštećen."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-benefits"
msgid "Benefits"
msgstr "Prednosti"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid ""
"For the purpose of helping scientific progress and replication, sometimes we"
" may share the data with research collaborators."
msgstr ""
"U svrhu pomaganja znanstvenog napretka i replikacije, ponekad možemo "
"podijeliti podatke sa suradnicima u istraživanju."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid ""
"In these cases, we will only share fully anonymized data, such as "
"demographic, aggregated, or extracted data without any personal identifiers."
msgstr ""
"U tim ćemo slučajevima dijeliti samo potpuno anonimizirane podatke, poput "
"demografskih, agregiranih ili izdvojenih podataka bez osobnih "
"identifikatora."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid "Research collaborations"
msgstr "Istraživačke suradnje"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"All of the information we obtain during the research will be kept "
"confidential."
msgstr ""
"Sve informacije koje dobijemo tijekom istraživanja držat ćemo povjerljivima."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Although researchers will not use your alpha numeric code to derive your "
"real identity, this record could be linked in some cases to your public "
"profile page if a data breach takes place."
msgstr ""
"Iako istraživači neće koristiti vaš alfanumerički kod da utvrde vaš pravi "
"identitet, ovaj bi zapis u nekim slučajevima mogao biti povezan s vašom "
"javnom profilnom stranicom ako dođe do povrede podataka."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid "Consenting to these additional requirements is also fully voluntary."
msgstr "Pristanak na ove dodatne zahtjeve također je potpuno dobrovoljan."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"If an experiment is collecting data that cannot be fully anonymized, we will"
" inform you and also ask for additional consent."
msgstr ""
"Ako eksperiment prikuplja podatke koji se ne mogu u potpunosti "
"anonimizirati, obavijestit ćemo vas i također zatražiti dodatnu suglasnost."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"No personal identifiers (e.g. your name or contact data) will be collected "
"or used at any stage of the experiment."
msgstr ""
"Nikakvi osobni identifikatori (npr. vaše ime ili podaci za kontakt) neće se "
"prikupljati niti koristiti u bilo kojoj fazi eksperimenta."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"These include experiments where we make audio-visual recordings or where we "
"need your contact details to contact you in the future to take another "
"experiment."
msgstr ""
"To uključuje eksperimente u kojima izrađujemo audio-vizualne snimke ili gdje"
" su nam potrebni vaši podaci za kontakt kako bismo vas kontaktirali u "
"budućnosti radi poduzimanja drugog eksperimenta."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"This code will not be used to derive your real identity, will not be shared "
"with anyone outside of the research team and will be deleted after use."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj se kod neće koristiti za određivanje vašeg pravog identiteta, neće se "
"dijeliti ni s kim izvan istraživačkog tima i bit će izbrisan nakon "
"korištenja."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid "Thus, the experimental data is anonymous."
msgstr "Dakle, eksperimentalni podaci su anonimni."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Thus, you may wish to restrict what information you choose to share "
"publicly."
msgstr ""
"Stoga biste mogli ograničiti informacije koje želite javno podijeliti."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"We may collect some demographic data (e.g. age, gender, country of "
"residence) as well as information about your learning and exposure history "
"(e.g. musical experience playing an instrument, years of formal education, "
"languages spoken)."
msgstr ""
"Možemo prikupljati neke demografske podatke (npr. dob, spol, državu "
"prebivališta) kao i podatke o vašem učenju i povijesti izlaganja (npr. "
"glazbeno iskustvo sviranja instrumenta, godine formalnog obrazovanja, jezici"
" kojima se govori)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"We will only save your anonymized alpha numeric code in our system, in order"
" to distinguish participants who have already taken part in this or other "
"experiments."
msgstr ""
"U našem sustavu ćemo spremiti samo vaš anonimizirani alfanumerički kod, kako"
" bismo razlikovali sudionike koji su već sudjelovali u ovom ili drugim "
"eksperimentima."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"Finally, in some experiments you may be asked to make a voice or video "
"recording, for example, you may be asked to record your finger-tapping in "
"response to a sound or video, or to record yourself speaking or singing."
msgstr ""
"Konačno, u nekim eksperimentima od vas se može tražiti da snimite glas ili "
"video, na primjer, od vas se može tražiti da snimite svoje lupanje prstom "
"kao odgovor na zvuk ili video, ili da snimite sebe kako govorite ili "
"pjevate."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"For example, you may be asked to judge how pleasant a particular sound or an"
" image is, or to categorize sounds or images (e.g., if a sound or an image "
"is that of a car or a cow), or to judge other basic features of sounds or "
"images (e.g., how frequently do you encounter this type of sound or image? "
"how aesthetically pleasing you consider a particular sound or image?)."
msgstr ""
"Na primjer, od vas se može tražiti da procijenite koliko je ugodan određeni "
"zvuk ili slika, ili da kategorizirate zvukove ili slike (npr. jesu li zvuk "
"ili slika zvuk automobila ili krave), ili da procijenite druge osnovne "
"značajke zvukova ili slika (npr. koliko često susrećete ovu vrstu zvuka ili "
"slike? koliko estetski ugodnim smatrate određeni zvuk ili sliku?)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"If the experiment will contain these elements we will ask for an additional "
"consent."
msgstr ""
"Ako će eksperiment sadržavati ove elemente, tražit ćemo dodatnu suglasnost."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"If you volunteer to participate in this study, you will be asked to perform "
"simple tasks using your keyboard or mouse while listening to sounds, or "
"while observing images or videos."
msgstr ""
"Ako dobrovoljno sudjelujete u ovoj studiji, od vas će se tražiti da izvršite"
" jednostavne zadatke pomoću tipkovnice ili miša dok slušate zvukove ili dok "
"promatrate slike ili videozapise."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"In some experiments, we may use mild deception, i.e., we may not explain the"
" full truth regarding an experimental task (for example we will not tell you"
" that an image was generated by an artificial computer system and not a "
"human)."
msgstr ""
"U nekim eksperimentima možemo upotrijebiti blagu prijevaru, tj. možda nećemo"
" objasniti punu istinu u vezi s eksperimentalnim zadatkom (na primjer, "
"nećemo vam reći da je sliku generirao umjetni računalni sustav, a ne "
"čovjek)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"Mild deception will only be used in some experiments where we need to "
"prevent biasing the participants before taking the experiment."
msgstr ""
"Blaga obmana koristit će se samo u nekim eksperimentima gdje moramo "
"spriječiti pristranost sudionika prije poduzimanja eksperimenta."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid "Procedure"
msgstr "Postupak"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"The specific sounds, images, and videos used will vary, but may include: "
"recordings of ambient sounds, noise-bursts, speech, music, simple tones, "
"naturalistic images, animated images, comics, faces, objects, geometric "
"shapes, fractal images, or videos of natural environments."
msgstr ""
"Konkretni zvukovi, slike i videozapisi koji se koriste varirat će, ali mogu "
"uključivati: snimke ambijentalnih zvukova, buke, govora, glazbe, "
"jednostavnih tonova, naturalističkih slika, animiranih slika, stripova, "
"lica, objekata, geometrijskih oblika, fraktalnih slika, ili videozapise "
"prirodnih okruženja."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "Svrha"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid "For the Max-Planck-Society, this is:"
msgstr "Za Max-Planck-društvo, ovo je:"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid ""
"Note that in some studies data deletion will not be possible, in this case "
"we will ask you specifically to consent to this procedure in a separate "
"consent form."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da u nekim studijama brisanje podataka neće biti moguće, u "
"ovom slučaju ćemo vas posebno zamoliti da pristanete na ovaj postupak u "
"zasebnom obrascu za pristanak."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid ""
"You also have the right to submit an objection to the supervisory authority."
msgstr "Također imate pravo podnijeti prigovor nadzornom tijelu."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid ""
"You have the right to information regarding the data relating to you that is"
" stored at the Max-Planck-Institute, the right to correct inaccurate data, "
"and the right to demand the deletion of data in cases of inadmissible data "
"storage and the right to data portability."
msgstr ""
"Imate pravo na informaciju o podacima koji se na Vas pohranjuju u Max-"
"Planck-Institutu, pravo na ispravak netočnih podataka te pravo zahtijevati "
"brisanje podataka u slučaju nedopuštene pohrane podataka i pravo na podatke "
"prenosivost."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid "Your rights"
msgstr "Vaša prava"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-risks"
msgid "Risks/Discomforts"
msgstr "Rizici/neugodnosti"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-risks"
msgid ""
"There are no risks for participating in this study beyond those associated "
"with normal computer use."
msgstr ""
"Nema rizika za sudjelovanje u ovoj studiji osim onih povezanih s normalnom "
"upotrebom računala."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"Data will be stored temporarily on external servers and desktops/laptops "
"that are password protected."
msgstr ""
"Podaci će biti privremeno pohranjeni na vanjskim poslužiteljima i "
"stolnim/prijenosnim računalima koji su zaštićeni lozinkom."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid "No data will be stored permanently on external servers."
msgstr ""
"Nikakvi podaci neće biti trajno pohranjeni na vanjskim poslužiteljima."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
