#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-overview"
msgid ""
"The purpose of this online form is to give you information to help you "
"decide whether you want to take part in a research study."
msgstr ""
"Svrha ovog online obrasca je pružiti vam informacije koje će vam pomoći da "
"odlučite želite li sudjelovati u istraživačkoj studiji."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-overview"
msgid ""
"This research is being conducted by researchers at the Max-Planck-Institute "
"for Empirical Aesthetics."
msgstr ""
"Ovo istraživanje provode istraživači s Max-Planck-Instituta za empirijsku "
"estetiku."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"Specifically, we aim to combine a wide range of behavioural methodologies to"
" characterize the ways in which people from diverse backgrounds internalize "
"and process external conditions, both in the auditory (e.g., speech, music) "
"and visual (e.g., faces, color) domains."
msgstr ""
"Konkretno, cilj nam je kombinirati širok raspon bihevioralnih metodologija "
"kako bismo okarakterizirali načine na koje ljudi iz različitih sredina "
"internaliziraju i obrađuju vanjske uvjete, kako u slušnoj (npr. govor, "
"glazba) tako i u vizualnoj (npr. lica, boja) domeni."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"The purpose of this project is to study the role of experience and exposure "
"in creating and affecting our perception, decisions and actions."
msgstr ""
"Svrha ovog projekta je proučavanje uloge iskustva i izloženosti u stvaranju "
"i utjecaju na našu percepciju, odluke i postupke."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"We are also interested in the way that these internal representations affect"
" human decision making and behaviour."
msgstr ""
"Također nas zanima način na koji te unutarnje reprezentacije utječu na "
"ljudsko odlučivanje i ponašanje."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"Audio-visual material will not be indexed by personal information but will "
"be linked to personal information by a key (such as “afasd12314asdasd”)."
msgstr ""
"Audio-vizualni materijal neće biti indeksiran osobnim podacima, već će biti "
"povezan s osobnim podacima ključem (kao što je \"afasd12314asdasd\")."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"During data collection, audio-visual material will be recorded on a separate"
" server."
msgstr ""
"Tijekom prikupljanja podataka, audio-vizualni materijal će se snimati na "
"zasebnom poslužitelju."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"Personal information will be stored separately from audio-visual materials "
"and encrypted using a strong encryption protocol (such as Advanced "
"Encryption Standard)."
msgstr ""
"Osobni podaci bit će pohranjeni odvojeno od audio-vizualnih materijala i "
"šifrirani pomoću jakog protokola šifriranja (kao što je Advanced Encryption "
"Standard)."

